      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Hosted half",
      "items": [
        "Guardrails enforced in code: budgets, gates, verbatim evidence, no send capability",
        "Durable runs: state and alarm commit in one transaction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "The bridge",
      "items": [
        "GET /api/runs/:id/handoff exports evaluated postings, decisions and drafts, never the profile",
        "tools/import_jobpilot.py writes canonical keys, skips seen URLs and keys, never creates tracker rows"
      ]
    },
    {
